  "details": "Confirm on Quest.\nExpected behavior:\nAttachment 1; A pick up highlight only fills the mirror itself.\nActual behavior:\nAttachment 2; A blue pickup highlight of a personal mirror fills up an entire screen on a situation below.\nReproduction procedure:\n1. Turn on a personal mirror\n2. Set a mirror \"Masking\" to mask the environment (Condition 1)\n3. Set a mirror size 6 steps or more down (Condition 2)\n4. Point to the personal mirror to show a pickup highlight\n5. You can see your screen is filled up with blue (attachment 2).\nAll of these conditions must be met in order to reproduce this problem.\nAttachment 1 lacks the mirror mask condition and it behaves as intended.\nIf you set a mirror size 5 steps down, you can see a blue ring surrounding your screen (attachment 3).\nBest regards",
